// Moving by words goes forward to a word's end and back to its start, on
// every platform, so "cat's" is one word and the comma after "toy" none.
// Moving by sentences goes to a sentence's end before the spaces after
// it, and back to its start. A double click selects the word, or the
// space or punctuation, the cursor belongs with; a triple click the
// sentence, with the spaces after it.
